 location="Ventral part of the periaqueductal gray on either side of the midline at the superior colliculus level, dorsal to the MLF; the fascicles run ventrally through the tegmentum, red nucleus and medial crus to exit in the interpeduncular fossa.",
 subdivisions=[("Somatic subnuclei", "medial rectus, inferior rectus, inferior oblique (ipsilateral); superior rectus (contralateral); levator palpebrae (bilateral, central caudal nucleus)"), ("Edinger–Westphal nucleus", "preganglionic parasympathetic for the sphincter pupillae and ciliary muscle; also the efferent relay of the light and near reflexes")],
